    {
      "id": "3DE6EF0509D06C8B",
      "title": "&f&lBuild your foundation&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fYour five inner branches are Archery, Quick Draw, Trailcraft, Steady Aim and Fieldcraft. Each branch contains four mandatory foundation nodes. Complete their requirements, class mastery and the specialization gate before entering a subclass.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fTwenty inner foundation nodes are only part of the route; account for entry, root, mastery and gate nodes too.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "7958E9F37D53BEAC"
      ],
